## EvolutionApi

### List evolution chains
## List evolution chains
GET https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/evolution-chain/?limit={{limit}}&offset={{offset}}
Accept: application/json

### Get evolution chain
## Get evolution chain
GET https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/evolution-chain/{{id}}/
Accept: application/json

### List evolution triggers
## List evolution triggers
GET https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/evolution-trigger/?limit={{limit}}&offset={{offset}}&q={{q}}
Accept: application/json

### Get evolution trigger
## Get evolution trigger
GET https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/evolution-trigger/{{id}}/
Accept: application/json

### List evolution variables
## List evolution variables
GET https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/evolution-variable/?limit={{limit}}&offset={{offset}}&q={{q}}
Accept: application/json

### Get evolution variable
## Get evolution variable
GET https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/evolution-variable/{{id}}/
Accept: application/json
